    i18n_key_id: i18n_key:parameter_salesforce_contact_getMany_whatId_desc,
    language_code: 'fr',
    translated_text: 'The WhatId represents nonhuman objects such as accounts, opportunities, campaigns, cases, or custom objects. WhatIds are polymorphic. Polymorphic means a WhatId is equivalent to the ID of a related object.',
